      "content": "I am so incredibly sorry for the profound loss you are experiencing right now. Please know that the emptiness you feel is a raw expression of the love you shared. If the silence is too overwhelming, please reach out to a support line or a trusted person; you don't have to carry this unbearable quiet alone. Help is available, and someone is ready to listen to you.",
